# Design stack

One package that equips every agent on this machine for professional web design:
Astra and Codex (Windows app and WSL CLI), Claude (desktop app and WSL), and any
NormalAI that follows `/ai/governance/README.md`.

Installed 2026-09-22 under governance record `CR-20260922T164807Z-CLAUDE-3KX6H598`.

## Principle

Design decisions belong to whichever AI Mo asks for the work; a lead makes
them on work it leads, and Mo is above everyone. Skills are instruments: vocabulary, references and checks. One
creative-direction skill (Impeccable) plus specialists underneath it, never a
pile of competing "make it pretty" rulebooks. `DESIGN.md` and `PRODUCT.md` in
each project are the visual and product contract.

## Components

| Component | Role | Source / version | Installed for |
|---|---|---|---|
| `design-stack` | Router skill: loads this stack and the loop before UI work | this package, `skills/design-stack/` | 
all four skill roots |
| `impeccable` | Creative direction: shape, craft, critique, audit, polish, bolder, quieter, animate, typeset, layout, 
live; PRODUCT.md and DESIGN.md; 61 detectors | `pbakaus/impeccable` (npm 4.1.0, skill 4.3.1, engine 0.1.5) | WSL Codex 
+ Claude (with hooks); Windows copies without hooks |
| `gsap-*` (8) | Motion: core, timeline, scrolltrigger, plugins, react, performance, utils, frameworks | 
`greensock/gsap-skills` | all four roots |
| `vercel-react-best-practices` | React / Next.js performance | `vercel-labs/agent-skills` | all four roots |
| `web-design-guidelines` | Final interface, accessibility, UX audit (100+ rules, fetched live from Vercel) | 
`vercel-labs/agent-skills` | all four roots |
| `playwright-cli` | Eyes: open, resize, device emulation, screenshots | `@playwright/cli` 0.1.21 + Chromium 1246 | 
